+### D. Safety and domain profile
+
+Red flags are derived from the engine output, never invented: `critical` ΓåÆ critical flag, `high` ΓåÆ high flag, `stop_orals` ΓåÆ stop-oral-steroids flag, bilirubin > 1.5├ù together with elevated/high ALT/AST ΓåÆ cholestatic-pattern flag, reading older than 90 days ΓåÆ stale flag. Box 7 also lists what **not** to do and when to seek medical care, and states that the tool does not diagnose or prescribe. The red-flag path is proven by the critical-case test (ALT 300 U/L) and the stale path by the 2020-01-01 reading test.
